---
// French mentions légales page (LEGAL-01): site publisher identity, hosting
// provider, and business status, per LCEN Article 1-1 (current text,
// effective 2024-05-23 — this article was renumbered by the SREN law from
// its long-standing pre-2024 citation; do not cite the old, abolished
// numbering here, 04-RESEARCH.md Pitfall 2).
//
// Hardcoded content (Pattern 3 — no Sanity fetch), same convention as
// src/pages/about.astro: legal copy needs developer review before any
// change, so it is not CMS-editable (04-RESEARCH.md "Don't Hand-Roll").
//
// Identity disclosure (D-08, RESOLVED): LCEN Article 1-1, I requires a
// professional editorial site to disclose the publisher's real legal name,
// not just a trade/brand name — "Romane Lepont, exerçant sous le nom
// commercial « Atelier Jacqueline Suzanne »".
//
// Address/phone (D-09, superseded 2026-08-26 by quick task 260826-r78): the
// site's editorial activity is declared non-professional under LCEN Article
// 1-1, II — which lets an individual substitute the identity already on file
// with their host for their own personal address/phone, rather than
// publishing the latter. Florian holds the actual OVH hosting account (see
// README.md "Author" / CLAUDE.md), so his identity — not Romane's — is what
// is genuinely on file with the host; the page discloses that fact directly
// rather than implying an inaccurate "given privately to the host" claim
// about Romane specifically. No phone number is published for either party.
//
// Hosting (D-07): OVH is now the actual, live production host — Phase 5/v1.7
// shipped 2026-08-13, the site no longer lives on GitHub Pages in production
// (GitHub Pages remains a separate pre-production staging environment per
// D-03). Address/RCS/APE details verified directly against OVH's own live
// mentions-légales page (ovhcloud.com/fr/terms-and-conditions/) during the
// original Phase 4 task — that page does not itself publish a phone number
// for OVH SAS, so none is asserted here (04-RESEARCH.md Assumption A2 delta,
// recorded in 04-01-SUMMARY.md).
//
// Business status (D-10, superseded 2026-08-26): now framed explicitly as
// non-professional (not just "non immatriculée"), matching the LCEN Art.
// 1-1, II classification above. Re-evaluate this entire block once the v1.x
// Shop/Checkout milestone ships real commerce — LCEN Section I (professional
// editor) will then unambiguously apply and this page will need Romane's own
// real address/phone, plus new CGV pages.
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Mentions légales — Atelier Jacqueline Suzanne">
  <div class="legal-page">
    <h1>Mentions légales</h1>

    <h2>Éditeur du site</h2>
    <p>Romane Lepont, exerçant sous le nom commercial « Atelier Jacqueline Suzanne », à titre non professionnel.</p>
    <p>Directeur de la publication : Romane Lepont.</p>
    <p>E-mail : contact@atelierjacquelinesuzanne.fr</p>
    <p>
      Le site étant édité à titre non professionnel, l'adresse et le numéro de téléphone
      personnels de l'éditrice ne sont pas publiés, conformément à l'article 1-1, II de la loi
      n° 2004-575 du 21 juin 2004 pour la confiance dans l'économie numérique.
    </p>
    <p>
      Le site est hébergé via le compte d'hébergement OVH de Florian Lepont, domicilié au [adresse retirée].
    </p>

    <h2>Hébergement</h2>
    <p>
      OVH SAS — RCS Lille Métropole 424 761 419 00045 — Code APE 2620Z. Siège social : 2 rue
      Kellermann, 59100 Roubaix, France.
    </p>

    <h2>Statut</h2>
    <p>
      Statut : activité individuelle à titre non professionnel — activité occasionnelle en
      dessous du seuil imposant l'immatriculation.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-2xl) var(--space-md);
  }

  .legal-page h1 {
    font-size: var(--text-display-size); /* Display role */
    font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-xl);
  }

  .legal-page h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-heading-size); /* Heading role */
    font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: var(--space-2xl) 0 var(--space-md);
  }

  .legal-page p {
    font-size: var(--text-body-size); /* Body role */
    font-weight: var(--weight-regular);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-md);
  }

  .legal-page .placeholder {
    font-style: italic;
  }
</style>
